&lt;p&gt;Moving to Arnold means waking up to water views and ending your day with sunset over the Chesapeake Bay. This Anne Arundel County community sits on the Broadneck Peninsula, where the Magothy River meets the Severn River, giving residents boat access to the bay without leaving the neighborhood.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>